Package: revertscope
Type: Package
Title: Transcriptomic Perturbation and Intervention Response Classification
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "RevertScope", family = "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mzw423502@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: A local analysis workflow for independent-replicate bulk RNA-seq
    counts. It fits a unified limma-voom model and exports covariance-aware
    perturbation, intervention and residual effects, evidence-aware response
    classes, response maps, tables, reports and reopenable project bundles.
